          "items": [
            "Shoreline 9 Unit 5 by Oversee | Perfect in Walton County Awards – Three-Time Diamond Winner – Best Rental Mgmt. 2026, 2025, 2024<br><br>Right on the Gulf in Inlet Beach, Shoreline 9 Unit 5 is a relaxing escape for a small family or couple looking for peace, quiet, and incredible views. Plus, you're just steps to the sand!<br><br>Highlights<br>📍 Inlet Beach<br>😲 Great views<br>👣 Just steps to Lupine Beach Access!<br>🌿 Camp Helen State Park: your next-door neighbor<br>🛏️ 2 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>🍤 Grill<br>🚲 2 bikes included. Explore Rosemary Beach, 30Avenue<br>🍤 Great restaurants<br>🍦 Fun eateries and boutiques<br><br>Inlet Beach sits between Camp Helen State Park and Rosemary Beach, making it easy to explore scenic trails, stroll along the shore, or bike to nearby restaurants and shops. Just offshore, the Inlet Beach Grouper Reef, part of the SWARA reef system, offers a unique spot for snorkeling.<br><br>Inside, the second-floor living, dining, and kitchen area opens to a balcony with views in both directions—sunrises on one side, sunsets on the other. Upstairs, the primary suite and guest bedrooms each have private balconies with even more to take in.<br><br>We’re excited to have you! Oversee is a small, locally owned team that takes pride in providing spotless homes and a seamless experience. We’re open seven days a week with a 24/7 emergency line. Need anything? Our office is just a few miles away, and we’re happy to help!<br><br>Overview:<br>- Great views<br>- 2 bedrooms, 2.5 baths<br>- 1,080 sq ft<br>- Grill<br>- Outdoor shower<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- 2 bikes included<br> <br>Overnight:<br>FIRST FLOOR<br>- Queen sleeper sofa in living room<br> SECOND FLOOR<br>- Primary Bedroom: King bed, full bath, TV<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen bed and twin bunk, full bath, TV<br> <br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.",
