    "description": [
      "Located in Inlet Beach, a neighborhood in Panama City Beach, this vacation home is near a water park and by the sea. The area's natural beauty can be seen at Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach, while Frank Brown Park and Shipwreck Island Waterpark are popular area attractions. Emerald Coast Mirror Maze and SkyWheel are also worth visiting. Be sure to check out the area's animals with activities such as game walks and birdwatching."
